# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Never commit real URLs with secrets
# (this file itself holds no secrets and is safe to commit).
#
# Local dev: leave EMPTY (same-origin /api via the Vite dev proxy).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
#
# Production on Vercel: leave EMPTY. `frontend/vercel.json` rewrites /api/* to
# the Render service, so the browser only uses the Vercel origin and the
# __Host-lq_session cookie remains first-party.
#
# Same-site custom domains are the only alternative: use the API subdomain with
# NO trailing slash and NO /api suffix, then REDEPLOY (Vite embeds it at build
# time). Shape only — use your real hostname:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
# Do NOT point *.vercel.app directly at *.onrender.com: the SameSite=Lax
# session cookie is cross-site and will not be sent.
